ay candidates under `repos/gh/`, about 0.6 GB in total:\n- **Hackathon/demo stores:**\n  - 164imran/hack_paris, alexandre-martel/rseach, alexdebelka/guillotine\n  - alvaro5/, aminechr54/, ansh2508/, gablandman/, valikprogrammer/ (all ehl-paris medical-retrieval)\n  - chenxshuo/researcher-baobyte (182M), enyolanev-bit/lucky-loop, gabriel-libardi/latenthackers, jakobtfr/ehl-paris\n  - luraxx/msd-floorplan-challenge, ouazzmoh/bourbaki-paris-2, sokcevic/hackathon-paris, tangafua/tum.ai-hackathon, yudjinsud/masloriji (106M)\n- **Ours, but dead:**\n  - entireio/entire-sem (65M; the old name of entire-graph)\n  - entireio/acme-payments (fixture)\n  - cli/cli (341M; GitHub's gh, not ours)\n- **Under `repos/local/`:** about 90 empty `cli-<hash>` dirs, plus test leftovers (demo-repo, myproject, proj, proj2, repro-dirty-gate, the 2 image-mocktest stores, entire-native).\n\n**NOT on my list:**\n- suhaanthayyil/bioinformed-brca-risk: Suhaan's own repo; leave it.\n- ashtom/entire-brain (3.6G), entirehq/entire.io (11G), entirehq/entire-api (650M), entirehq/devenv: these come under your full-store decision after fix #1.\n\n**Graph numbers you can use** (latest main, warm cache):\n- def/neighbors/impact take about 0.4-0.67 s.\n- `graph context` takes 0.18 s.\n- The sqlite store is 18-27x bigger and is only written with `ENTIRE_GRAPH_SEARCH_STORE=1`. Without that env var, `store` and `context` return `store_unavailable`. If Brain relies on `graph store`, check whether your setup sets that var. That could be the \"search store not built for this commit\" you saw.\n- Exact-name queries can take 355 s on entire-graph (alias git-grep preselect). That's my top fix, and it's the same class as your reviewer's 45.9 s preselect."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"407b05fb-7281-4f82-b940-f7820c71a1f2","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgMWYhxGh9zURN6zbmCCv","requestRef":"27ce6d31-e27e-49b2-a4cb-58955d253dc1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1747f8d1-85c7-4c77-8ad8-2