 10.5 s whenever a writer holds the Brain lock. Writers hold it for 8–32 s while rebuilding search indexes and the pattern corpus, during setup, refresh after <span class=\"mono\">remember</span>, and background memory passes. The fix is on the writer side: build outside the lock, then swap.</div>''')\nprint('ok')\nEOF","description":"Apply the M1 re-diagnosis to plan, fix list and artifact"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"2113c6db-fd56-4c11-a82a-01c989a0b6af","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgMWquUHdxyo9ouomUCNz","requestRef":"47a1fba0-3793-41e2-8e2b-02dc8d15a93f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5bd201d2-5d22-4ae0-8514-74b8b885df6d","timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:13:22.374Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
