{"parentUuid":"cba64fbd-b5c8-4e11-874b-703a031b622c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14761588 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2ad2de67-c1bd-4138-98f1-56c34dff1571","timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:15:11.586Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14761588 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
{"parentUuid":"2ad2de67-c1bd-4138-98f1-56c34dff1571","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMX15tr3bBaxEjewy2FV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The graph timing study is done, so both tabs of the overview page are now filled. Brain is re-indexing. I'm waiting on a second agent that is checking the graph fix list against the source code.\n\n**Overview page:** https://claude.ai/artifact/FkY6c5J1XdzaYGM1Q7T9dU. The old link stopped working when you re-logged in on the new account.\n\n**Graph timing**\n- **Worst problem:** searching entire-graph for an exact name like `SearchRepository` took **355 s**. Almost all of it is one `git grep` running a regex over the whole commit. The same step costs 8 s on cli, and a plain-text search would take about 40 ms. That's fix #1 on my list.\n- **Faster than the September build:**\n  - warm queries are 2–6x faster;\n  - cold builds are about 1.8x faster and use half the memory;\n  - a second worktree reuses the cache;\n  - the old build hangs on every graph-building command in the entire-graph repo.\n- **Slower:**\n  - the first query in a repo (16 s, was 14 s);\n  - warm `def`/`neighbors`/`impact` (0.66 s, was 0.45 s), because every cache hit re-sorts the history.\n- **One fix already measured:** letting the indexing pipeline run past a slow file cuts cold index time by 29–36%, with identical output.\n\n**Graph fix list** (`devenv-worktrees/timing/GRAPH-SPEEDUPS.md`)\n- 10 speed fixes.\n- 3 wrong-answer bugs, including `neighbors` missing calls made through function values.\n- 3 items blocking Brain, including the graph refusing to index partial clones.\n\nWhen the source check comes back, I start fixing them one PR each, with old/new timings taken on a quiet machine.\n\n**Cleanup**\n- Deleted 59 stale devenv clones, the Ollama models (9.5 GB) and five old Rust toolchains. Free space went from 254 GB to 284 GB.\n- **I held back the 63 paths under `~/Documents/Coding`** that were on the same list:\n  - three are in use right now: `BFF` has a Claude Code session open, and `tsa` and `RP` have dev servers running;\n  - `fresh-env-repo-cli` is our test harness;\n  - the rest mix your personal projects with old Entire experiment clones.\n\n  The list is in `devenv-worktrees/cleanup-audit/held-documents-coding.txt`, and it's on the board as waiting on you.\n- The Brain session will delete its unused hackathon/demo stores after its re-index. It's keeping one outside repo (GitHub's own `cli`) as a scale test sample.\n\n**Brain session corrections, now reflected everywhere**\n- **Brief timeouts:** `brief` fails because writers hold the lock for 8–32 s while rebuilding indexes. Readers hold it for microseconds, and that lock keeps answers consistent with privacy deletions, so it stays. The fix is for writers to build first and only take the lock to swap the new file in. The Brain session is taking that as its own PR with a second review.\n- **`remember`/`recall`:** the \"can't recall what you just remembered\" report was its own mistake. It saved memories to one branch and searched from another. What's left is a smaller usability issue."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1095,"cache_read_input_tokens":219750,"output_tokens":1097,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1095,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1097,"cache_read_input_tokens":219750,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1095,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1095},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":