{"parentUuid":"04ee66b8-5282-4893-a928-a74828faa189","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgMa2ovKoaWvUX2BvPGkm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The graph review is in, and the first three fixes are now in progress, each in its own worktree and PR.\n\n**What the review changed**\n- **The 6-minute search** isn't about exact names. The word \"Repository\" has an abbreviation alias (\"repo\"), and that route runs a regex `git grep` over the whole commit. 97% of the time goes on 226 MB of generated parser files the graph never indexes. Skipping them brings it to about 1.3 s with identical results. The same problem explains Brain's 45 s search.\n- **Partial clones:** the root cause is found. Worse than we thought, every query on cli and entiredb has been rebuilding from scratch, because the cache path refuses those repos. The fix allows them when git is 2.45 or newer (this machine has 2.54), because those versions can be told never to fetch over the network. It keeps the refusal for older git.\n- **Pipeline speedup:** the first patch failed existing tests and could deadlock. The reviewer rebuilt it so that it keeps order and passes the tests, still cutting cold indexing by 26–33%.\n- **Two fixes were cut back:** one wasn't free (today the first answer differs from later ones), and one proposed caching scheme was unsafe.\n\n**Running now:**\n1. the alias search fix;\n2. the pipeline speedup;\n3. partial-clone indexing.\n\nThey share a lock file so that only one of them times things at once. They also hold off whenever the Brain session marks itself as measuring. The next wave (history cache fix, first-query fix, tool-detection fix) starts when these report.\n\nThe artifact's Graph tab now shows the reviewed fix list: https://claude.ai/artifact/FkY6c5J1XdzaYGM1Q7T9dU"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2557,"cache_read_input_tokens":266509,"output_tokens":934,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":363},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2557,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":934,"cache_read_input_tokens":266509,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2557,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2557},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9fc975fd-584b-4479-9667-47ec97d67603","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgMa2oeC4TaS8jYweXnmX","requestRef":"9749f798-15c7-4c0d-9e91-7519a6f1fa9a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c472ce74-6f8b-41b0-a0db-0d0e243fcb95","timestamp":"2026-10-24T18:55:07.984Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"6e41b4d8-b432-41b0-bc86-517a25b228fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"b0108f24-43a4-413e-94c9-bd361b6fafc5","version":"2.1.310","gitBranch":"main","slug":"lets-plan-cool-then-fluffy-walrus"}
